Foley: sound effects as code
============================

This folder is a detached fork of the model-free sound-effects part of "earshot"
(https://github.com/Leonxlnx/earshot, version 0.4.0, commit 591fa3e028032e6dce56620a20e932e35667e8d8),
Copyright (c) 2026 Leon Lin, released under the MIT License (LICENSE.earshot in this folder).

What was taken: the sound bank (252 effects as recipes, fitted models and parameters), the recipes and dsp/fx
helpers behind it, the knobs (duration, apex, pitch), the audit (sfx.check), the measuring of onset / peak / end
(bank.times) and the kits with their presets (forge/kits/*.json, including the "launch" preset with its per-role
offsets). What was left out: the listening models, the search and critic loops, the command line and the reference
sets. The package was renamed, the reporting and audio helpers replaced by small local ones (report.py, audio.py,
wavio.py, config.py) and the recipe module path adapted. The fork evolves on its own.

The mixing, mastering and export code that uses it lives outside this folder (editing/motion_sound.py).
